WEBVTT

00:00:02.580 --> 00:00:07.580
Thanks for taking the time to learn more about the CMU Dietrich DEI survey.

00:00:07.580 --> 00:00:11.580
After any departmental or Dietrich-wide DEI effort,

00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:17.580
a dynamic Google form prompts volunteers or administrators to upload their programmatic data.

00:00:17.580 --> 00:00:21.580
They can choose a primary goal to relate the initiative to,

00:00:21.580 --> 00:00:25.580
then fill out the corresponding information about attendees or other logistics.

00:00:25.580 --> 00:00:29.580
The form should not take longer than five minutes to fill out.

00:00:29.580 --> 00:00:32.580
Responses will be stored in an Excel spreadsheet.

00:00:32.580 --> 00:00:36.580
By studying this spreadsheet and viewing interesting Tableau visualizations,

00:00:36.580 --> 00:00:42.580
the Dietrich DEI Dean can identify and share trends in the history of past events.

00:00:42.580 --> 00:00:49.580
The data stored in this form would be a powerful tool to measure the reach and effectiveness of initiatives.

00:00:49.580 --> 00:00:51.580
We look forward to seeing your responses.
